         <div type="letter">
<div type="address">
<ab>

</ab>
</div>

<div type="mainBody"> 
<p>With <name type="person" key="bors73">
                            <choice>
                                <sic>doctors</sic>
                                <corr>doctor’s</corr>
                            </choice>
                        </name> leave starting for <name type="geo" key="G_GBR_LOND">London</name> today unfortunately this morning <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">relapse threatened but will travel</seg> kindest regards <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                    </p>
</div>
</div>

<div type="notes">
<note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">Despite his ocular and dental ailments, <name type="person" key="joyc82">JJ</name> travelled to <name type="geo" key="G_GBR_LOND">London</name> in <date when="1922-08">August 1922</date>, with the permission of his Paris oculist Dr Louis Borsch, and stayed at the <name type="geo" key="G_GBR_LOND_02">Euston Hotel</name> (<hi rend="italic">
                        <name type="work">JJ</name>
                    </hi> 536-37).</note>
</div>

      </body>
